Venus shortwave spectral file, 280 bands, 0.175-20 microns
==========================================================

Recipe for sp_sw_280_je_venus: 13 gases (H2O, CO2, SO2, N2, CO, OCS, H2S,
HDO, HCl, HF, cis-OSSO, trans-OSSO, OSO-S), H2O-H2O and CO2-CO2 continua,
and five aerosol slots holding the Venus cloud modes. The p-T grid,
data/gases/ptVenus, runs from 3.3e-6 to 9.2e6 Pa and 92 to 781 K.

Environment
-----------
VENUS_SW_WORK   work directory; line-by-line files go in lbl/, k files and
                the spectral file in sp/
LINE_DATA_DIR   directory holding the line lists listed below
VENUS_SW_PROCS  OpenMP threads per Ccorr_k call (each script has a default)

Container and build
-------------------
podman_socrates   runs a command (or a shell) in the lfric_dev container
build             builds SOCRATES: ./podman_socrates ./build
check_corr_k      checks corr_k and prep_spec against examples/corr_k
check_je_file     runs an existing JE file through l_run_cdf and compares
                  with JE's stored output: ./check_je_file <je_ref_dir>
num_diff          number-by-number comparison of two text files

Spectral file
-------------
env_sw_280_venus             paths, maximum absorber paths, data file names
mk_sp_sw_280_je_venus_skel   skeleton: bands, gases, continua, aerosols
mk_<gas>_lbl_sw_280_je_venus line-by-line absorption for one gas (slow)
mk_sp_sw_280_je_venus        k-terms from the line-by-line files, then the
                             spectral file
run_scatter                  Mie optics of the cloud modes -> .mon files;
                             mode 2 carries 1.5% FeCl3
fecl3.mon                    precomputed optics for the "soluble" slot
cis-OSSO.uvxsc, trans-OSSO.uvxsc, OSO-S.uvxsc, pt_single
                             UV cross-sections for the OSSO isomers

Column runs
-----------
mk_venus_atm            venus_atm_obs_so2.raw and the venus_mode* cloud
                        profiles -> venus.<suffix> netCDF inputs
planet.nml              Venus constants for Cl_run_cdf -N
Run: Cl_run_cdf -N planet.nml -B venus -s sp_sw_280_je_venus -R 1 280 -S
     -r -g 4 -u -C 5 -ch 280 -a

Line lists (not in git)
-----------------------
HITRAN2020 (doi:10.1016/j.jqsrt.2021.107949). .par: air-broadened,
downloaded 2022-10-27 (H2S 2022-11-15). .bpar: bespoke format, all CO2
isotopologues with self-broadening, 2022-11-15. .par_co2: CO2-broadened,
2022-11-15. .bpar and .par_co2 are read with Ccorr_k -BD, .par with -D.

